WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.900
The ring was built to continue.

00:02.080 --> 00:02.680
To turn.

00:03.180 --> 00:05.610
To carry day across its inner world.

00:06.110 --> 00:08.310
Now the filament pulses outside

00:08.360 --> 00:09.100
tolerance.

00:09.460 --> 00:11.090
The shadow-squares have slipped.

00:11.570 --> 00:14.530
Across inhabited arcs, daylight arrives

00:14.580 --> 00:15.000
wrong.

00:15.650 --> 00:16.870
Seasons overlap.

00:17.370 --> 00:19.370
The Meridian Compact is preparing

00:19.450 --> 00:22.320
Anchor: synchronize essential systems;

00:22.790 --> 00:24.300
preserve selected arcs.

00:25.430 --> 00:28.100
Bastion Four to civil grid: hold

00:28.160 --> 00:29.140
synchronization.

00:29.610 --> 00:31.370
We still have cities under that light.

00:31.870 --> 00:34.560
The Axiom Choir is preparing Migration:

00:35.210 --> 00:37.780
selected sectors, stored momentum, a

00:37.860 --> 00:40.090
biological archive bound for another

00:40.130 --> 00:40.530
star.

00:41.030 --> 00:44.230
Choir relay: launch geometry confirmed.

00:44.650 --> 00:46.990
Archive integrity remains below

00:47.080 --> 00:47.810
consensus.

00:48.860 --> 00:51.050
The Spinal Network can authorize one

00:51.120 --> 00:52.610
habitat-scale correction.

00:53.060 --> 00:53.520
One.

00:53.820 --> 00:55.650
Two survivable futures are being

00:55.710 --> 00:56.290
prepared.

00:56.490 --> 00:59.150
Preserve a home, or carry life beyond

00:59.220 --> 00:59.370
it.

00:59.840 --> 01:01.440
The ring cannot grant both.

01:01.940 --> 01:03.840
This record now enters the Last

01:03.930 --> 01:04.530
Rotation.
